        <item>
            <title>0.3.13</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 20:10:29 +1000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/james1239090/TinyCrop-Downloads/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>TinyCrop 0.3.13</h2>
<ul>
  <li>「全部關閉」改為每批關閉多張已儲存照片，減少逐張重整照片清單與預覽的負擔。</li>
  <li>批次之間持續更新旋轉動畫與數字進度，讓大量照片關閉時仍能看出 App 正在運作。</li>
  <li>遇到未儲存照片時才暫停並詢問，選擇取消會停止後續批次。</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
