            <title>0.3.12</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 10:13:26 +1000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/james1239090/TinyCrop-Downloads/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.12</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>TinyCrop 0.3.12</h2>
<ul>
  <li>客製預設的刪除功能移到裁切下拉選單底部，並只在選取客製預設時顯示。</li>
  <li>「全部關閉」會逐張關閉所有照片，以動畫及數字顯示進度，並詢問是否儲存尚未儲存的照片。</li>
  <li>在未儲存提示選擇取消時，會停止後續的全部關閉流程。</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
